                    <div class="text-xs text-woodsmoke-400 mt-0.5 leading-relaxed">The agreement governing your use of Grabbn.</div>
                </div>
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="shrink-0 text-woodsmoke-300 mt-1 group-hover:text-orchid-400 transition-colors"><path fill="currentColor" d="M9.293 18.707a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.414L14.586 12 9.293 6.707a1 1 0 0 1 1.414-1.414l6 6a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.414l-6 6a1 1 0 0 1-1.414 0"/></svg>
