                <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-md bg-orchid-50 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5 text-orchid-600">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><g fill="none"><path fill="currentColor" d="M3.783 4.826A2 2 0 0 1 5.28 3.116l5.513-1.378a4 4 0 0 1 1.96 0l5.514 1.378A2 2 0 0 1 19.78 4.83L20 12c0 4.392-3.375 7.801-7.267 9.46a2 2 0 0 1-1.527 0C7.314 19.8 4 16.392 4 12z"/></g></svg>
                </div>
                <div class="flex-1 min-w-0">
                    <div class="text-sm font-semibold text-woodsmoke-900">Privacy Policy</div>
                    <div class="text-xs text-woodsmoke-400 mt-0.5 leading-relaxed">How Grabbn collects, uses, and protects your data.</div>
